  m_text: 'Please enter your full name (optional).



    Greetings! We are fourth-year
    Bachelor of Science in Information Technology (BSIT) students from STI College
    Caloocan.



    As part of our final Capstone Project, we will collect and analyze
    information provided from your gameplay, including your assessment scores and
    learning progress, for academic research purposes.



    Providing your name
    is entirely optional. All collected personal information and gameplay data will
    be handled confidentially and in accordance with the Data Privacy Act of 2012
    (Republic Act No. 10173).



    Thank you very much for your participation and
    valuable contribution to our research!'
